# REQUIRES: python-api, torch, torchpme
# The Coulomb part of the gradients of the energy of a frame in the
# positions and in the strain (D[frame-gradients], docs/python-frames.md)
# against torch-pme (Loche et al., J. Chem. Phys. 162, 142501 (2025)), an
# independent differentiable PME, on the CPU, in double and mixed precision,
# Inputs/python_frame_gradients.py: the gradients of the evaluator at the
# charges of the model less those at charges of zero, against the autograd
# of PyTorch in the positions and in a strain of torch-pme's sum of the
# mesh with the pair sums written in PyTorch, at the same positions, cell,
# charges, splitting parameter, and grid. The dipeptide in water in an
# orthorhombic cell at 64 and 128 points, and water in a rhombic
# dodecahedron at 32 and 64; the tolerance is three times what the two
# programs change by between the grids.
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_gradients.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torchpme CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=DIPEPTIDE,CHECK -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_gradients.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torchpme-water CPU Double | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=WATER,CHECK -DMODE="CPU Double"
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_gradients.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torchpme CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=DIPEPTIDE,CHECK -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_gradients.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide torchpme-water CPU Mixed | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=WATER,CHECK -DMODE="CPU Mixed"
# DIPEPTIDE: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide in water, 1168 particles, 79024 pairs: the Coulomb part of G against torch-pme, grid 64
# DIPEPTIDE: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide in water: the Coulomb part of the nine components of S, grid 64
# DIPEPTIDE: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide in water: the same at 128 points, G
# DIPEPTIDE: [[MODE]]: the dipeptide in water: the same at 128 points, S
# WATER: [[MODE]]: water in a rhombic dodecahedron, 1209 particles, 124961 pairs: the Coulomb part of G against torch-pme, grid 32
# WATER: [[MODE]]: water in a rhombic dodecahedron: the Coulomb part of the nine components of S, grid 32
# WATER: [[MODE]]: water in a rhombic dodecahedron: the same at 64 points, G
# WATER: [[MODE]]: water in a rhombic dodecahedron: the same at 64 points, S
# CHECK: torchpme passed
